/P 5049 0 R
/E (This course provides students with a comprehensive understanding of data management, including relational database systems, data modelling, and SQL. It emphasizes practical application, data governance, quality, ethics, and data integrity. Students learn to design, implement, and administer databases effectively and are equipped with digital skills, including cloud-based solutions and digital tools. The course also enhances communication abilities, preparing students to navigate data management in diverse professional settings and adapt to emerging trends. At the end of the course, students will be well-prepared to navigate the intricacies of data management in diverse professional settings, possessing a versatile skill set that includes database design, practical implementation, effective communication, and adaptability to emerging digital trends.)
