/P 5055 0 R
/E (This course provides a comprehensive introduction to the fundamental mathematical concepts and techniques essential for understanding and implementing machine learning algorithms. Students will gain a deep understanding of linear algebra, matrix decomposition, vector calculus, data modeling, and parameter estimation, all of which are critical foundations for machine learning. Equipped with the basic concepts and how to fit into the larger context of machine learning, Therefore, these courses spend on background mathematics.)
