<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 5072 0 R
/E (In this course, students will explore the fascinating realm of algorithms and models inspired by natural intelligence. Students will gain a deep understanding of the theories and skills to model the domain problem with the appropriate techniques and algorithms in Computational Algorithm. Students will be exposed to topics including Neural Network, Evolutionary Computation and Fuzzy Logic with the hands-on to apply the algorithms in solving the problems at hand. At the end of the course, students should be able to appreciate the contribution of CI in solving real-world problems which include designing, developing and optimizing intelligent systems.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [14]
>>
