1754 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 5075 0 R
/E (This course addresses the ethical considerations and responsibilities that must be considered concerning artificial intelligence. It encompasses organizational practices and responsibilities to ensure the development and operation of AI in a positive, accountable, and ethical manner. With appropriate ethics and responsibility, the objective of this course is to equip students with the knowledge and guided skill set necessary to develop AI for the benefit of society and technology consumers. In addition, the course underlines the significance of comprehending the risk, impacts and threats posed by new developments in AI technology, as well as the application of present regulations. Ethical issues in AI, AI governance, AI system transformation, ethical risk assessment and management, ethical matrices, along with societal and educational AI ethics will be among the subjects covered.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
