1757 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 5078 0 R
/E (This course emphasizes the practical implementation and real-world applications of AI across diverse sectors, prioritizing verifiable and explainable AI methodologies. Through immersive case studies, students will gain exposure to implementing AI solutions in various domains, emphasizing the verifiability and explainability of the AI algorithms and models used. Moreover, students actively participate in real-world AI applications within their chosen domain, emphasizing problem-solving, verifiable implementation, and clear presentation of findings. At the end of the course, students will develop a strong foundation for applying AI techniques across diverse domains, enabling them to make informed decisions while emphasizing trustworthy and explainable solutions in the AI application landscape.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [20]
>>
