/E (This elective course explores the emerging field of Intelligent Digital Twin within the context of Artificial Intelligence. A Digital Twin is a virtual representation of a real-world system or process, and the integration of intelligence enhances its capabilities for analysis, prediction, and decision-making. The course focuses on the principles, technologies, and applications of Intelligent Digital Twins in various domains. This course also explores the synergies between Intelligent Digital Twins and System Thinking. It integrates the principles of system thinking to provide a holistic understanding of complex systems. Students will engage in projects or case studies and apply system thinking approaches to design Digital Twins.)
