1879 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 5185 0 R
/E (This course equips students with the understanding of artificial intelligence \(AI\) as an essential technology in pursuing a digital transformation journey. The course is mainly into two main sections. In the first section, AI applications and tools based on real world cases in various functions of a business operations from different domains such as retail, financial, healthcare, creative media and agriculture will be discussed and highlighted. In the second section, digital strategies using AI for driving business transformation will be discussed. Based on the topics covered in both sections, students are required to recommend an AI solution for a given case study through a group project. Students will also explore the issues and challenges of adopting AI technologies in addition to its benefits and learn the implementation aspect of digital transformation.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
