/P 5188 0 R
/E (This course provides an in-depth exploration of the strategic integration of Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) in business models. It is designed to equip students with the knowledge and skills needed to understand, plan, and implement AI solutions as added value within various business contexts based on Business Model elements. The course covers a broad range of topics, from the foundational aspects of business AI technology to its practical applications in enhancing business operations and competitive advantage.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [14]
>>
