/P 5194 0 R
/E (AI Powered Talent Management \(TM\) focuses on optimizing human resources management through the integration of artificial intelligence \(AI\). The course is organized into three categories: first, addressing the basics with an emphasis on understanding TM processes and AI integration. The second category explores practical AI applications in recruitment, onboarding, performance management, and strategic talent development. The third category explores the contextual aspects of security, privacy, future trends, and ethical considerations in AI and HR. Concluding with a hands-on project, students apply their knowledge to build a design of a practical AI-driven TM system for enhancing their skills on AI-Powered TM.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [20]
>>
