/E (Embracing the phrase of "AI without policy is dangerous & policy without AI is powerless," this course equips students with a harmonized understanding of AI policy, emphasizing the crucial balance between the \(1\) advancement of AI as a technology for STI policy and socioeconomic development; \(2\) policy process in making AI technology a success, and \(3\) adoption of AI as an analytical tool in the policy process. At the end of this course, the students are expected to understand the importance of AI for policy and play roles as professional policy actors.)
