/E (New students are required to register for the programme offered on the date determined by the University. New students who fail to register for the program without any acceptable reason will have their admission automatically withdrawn. The registration for senior students is done automatically by the university based on previous examination results. Senior students, who have discontinued their study because of deferment or being suspended, need to re-register for the program.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [4]
>>
